meeting-bot/zoom-auth.json

# Per-host bot credentials (docs/scaling-plan.md Phase C4). The whole tree,
# not the two known filenames: with N hosts there are 2N live session files
# plus whatever backups someone makes while rotating one, and an `auth.json`
# has leaked into this repo's history once already (docs/aws-ec2-deploy.md).
# An ignore listing only the names that existed when it was written would not
# have covered `bot-c/`, `auth.json.bak`, or a stray screenshot of a cookie.
# The README is the one tracked file - git can re-include it because
# `auth/` itself is not excluded, only its contents.
meeting-bot/auth/*
!meeting-bot/auth/README.md

# Audit reports that may quote real secret values found in scans
docs/secrets-audit.md

